-04T10:15:56Z","rt":21,"replies":3,"quotes":1,"likes":41,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"osemagnum","author_id":"348076594","text":"HMPV is an RNA virus that primarily spreads through respiratory droplets, direct contact with infected individuals, and contaminated surfaces.\n\nSymptoms of HMPV\n- Cough\n- Fever\n- Nasal congestion\n- Fatigue\n\nIn severe cases, especially among children, the elderly, or those with https://t.co/1EO6F4MktV","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":36,"subtree_size":8,"dt_root_h":0.014,"parent_id":"1875486095040745692","conversation_id":"1875486095040745692"},{"id":"1875774413754527873","x":0.69092,"y":5.0,"t":1736054445,"iso":"2025-01-05T05:20:45.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"HonAmbForChrist","author_id":"1425376416997199873","text":"@osemagnum https://t.co/gzf45sonWI","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":19.095,"parent_id":"1875486314595811584","conversation_id":"1875486095040745692"},{"id":"1875489898490425615","x":0.009116,"y":4.0,"t":1735986611,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:30:11.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":2,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"OsisiomaNdigbo","author_id":"1211738699408363520","text":"@osemagnum China again.\n\nWe are not yet through from the shock of Covid and then this.\n\nChina must be mischievous.","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.252,"parent_id":"1875486314595811584","conversation_id":"1875486095040745692"},{"id":"1875486523732201476","x":0.001025,"y":1.5,"t":1735985806,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:16:46.000Z","rt":15,"replies":4,"quotes":0,"likes":31,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"osemagnum","author_id":"348076594","text":"The situation is alarming, with reports of overwhelmed hospitals and increased cases of respiratory illnesses, particularly among children. Chinese health officials have implemented surveillance systems to detect and monitor unknown respiratory pathogens, and the World Health Organization (WHO) is closely monitoring the situation.\n\nWhile HMPV isn't new, having been first identified in 2001, its rising prevalence and potential to cause severe illness make it a significant concern. The lack of a vaccine or specific antiviral treatment for HMPV emphasizes the importance of preventive measures, such as wearing masks, maintaining hand hygiene, and avoiding crowded areas.","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":15,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.028,"parent_id":"1875486314595811584","conversation_id":"1875486095040745692"},{"id":"1875632623869161514","x":0.351134,"y":3.0,"t":1736020639,"iso":"2025-01-04T19:57:19.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"AbigailAdediran","author_id":"1502672431235883011","text":"@osemagnum Welcome back Doc. It's good to have you back here 🥂","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":9.704,"parent_id":"1875486523732201476","conversation_id":"1875486095040745692"},{"id":"1875558616381714900","x":0.173783,"y":2.0,"t":1736002994,"iso":"2025-01-04T15:03:14.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"issakorhllex","author_id":"4746828256","text":"@osemagnum Believing the virus is from China is a lie. That is propaganda of the highest order. The virus are from Europe. It is war weapons to depopulate the world, profitability and decolonisation of the people. Watch out for more virus in the future","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":4.803,"parent_id":"1875486523732201476","conversation_id":"1875486095040745692"},{"id":"1875491496184705353","x":0.012946,"y":1.0,"t":1735986992,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:36:32.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":2,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"OsisiomaNdigbo","author_id":"1211738699408363520","text":"@osemagnum China has become mischievous again","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,